   },
   "harm": "a peer disconnecting without answering pong could cause Remove() to steal connection retry slots from unrelated transactions",
   "hash": "fef57b9f8e2ac461",
   "history": [
    {
     "at": "2026-09-22T01:16:33+00:00",
     "blocking": false,
     "by": "run:20260922-0113",
     "cause": "rc:4066104589",
     "status": "open"
    }
   ],
   "id": "rc:4066104589",
   "kind": "correctness",
   "other_replies": [],
   "pin": null,
   "quote": "now a peer that completed the handshake (`fDisconnect=true`) but doesn't answer the pong would not get a `peer_ack`, but also wouldn't get a try back, so if we then call `Remove()` it could steal slot",
   "settled_by": null,
   "status": "open",
   "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36277#discussion_r4066104589"
  },
  {
   "after_reply": "no_reply",
